WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:05.560
Back in the 10th year of Yuankang our Xuan Kingdom's annual tax revenue could reach over 18 million taels.

00:06.560 --> 00:10.240
Why, when it reached Chancellor Xie only 10.5 million taels remained?

00:10.560 --> 00:13.387
I deserve death ten thousand times.

00:17.040 --> 00:20.720
Your Majesty after several major battles in recent years.

00:20.960 --> 00:26.560
Border trade with the Wuzhao was closed this lost a large amount of revenue.

00:27.040 --> 00:32.320
Your Majesty implemented benevolent policies for the people taxes everywhere were reduced, this.

00:32.520 --> 00:34.640
Lost another large amount of revenue.

00:35.560 --> 00:40.840
Your Majesty for Your Majesty's grand ambitions I will definitely find a way.

00:41.000 --> 00:45.400
To quickly fill the treasury physicians often say severe illness requires strong medicine.

00:45.480 --> 00:48.600
If there is any blame I will bear it.

00:50.480 --> 00:51.880
Alright, alright.

00:52.600 --> 00:56.960
I'm tired think it over yourself all withdraw.

00:57.040 --> 00:57.560
Yes.

00:57.640 --> 00:59.120
I take my leave.

01:07.240 --> 01:08.640
Come out.

01:19.040 --> 01:22.800
Your Majesty I have verified everything.

01:23.480 --> 01:29.240
The Xie family colluded with factions layered exploitation of state taxes originally two hundred taels of silver.

01:29.400 --> 01:33.720
When it reached the court only one hundred taels remained also.

01:33.800 --> 01:39.680
This year's Ministry of Revenue's list of official appointments more than half are Chen clan members the remaining half.

01:39.760 --> 01:43.320
Most are also from the Xie and Zu families and their retainers and students.

01:45.840 --> 01:50.640
As for the mad horse at the hunting ground that nearly collided with Your Majesty.

01:50.960 --> 01:56.720
I also heard some rumors saying according to informants.

01:57.200 --> 02:02.480
Because the Wuzhao are skilled with horses so in General Zu Yue's army they once developed a kind of.

02:02.560 --> 02:05.227
Fierce drug that can make warhorses go mad.

02:06.040 --> 02:08.440
Your Majesty be careful.

02:10.240 --> 02:16.040
And that mad horse that nearly collided with Your Majesty was exactly given this drug the informant also said.

02:16.400 --> 02:18.320
That drugged horse.

02:21.520 --> 02:23.000
Why are you beating around the bush?

02:23.080 --> 02:25.413
I told you to speak, so speak.

02:26.120 --> 02:30.480
That horse was originally meant for the second prince only.

02:30.560 --> 02:32.893
