02:57.280 --> 02:59.320
Chancellor Xie Jian'an.

03:01.200 --> 03:03.080
Really got his money's worth.

03:04.360 --> 03:09.467
Now we are not yet firmly established it's not yet time to move against them.

03:10.240 --> 03:12.880
I have a word of warning for you.

03:13.600 --> 03:18.480
Don't trust and rely too much on your subordinates don't become their puppet.

03:18.560 --> 03:20.893
You and your elder brother are family.

03:25.400 --> 03:29.800
Father really had it difficult back then you lamented the great families growing powerful.

03:29.960 --> 03:35.120
Restraining you everywhere but now the state still has many matters.

03:35.200 --> 03:39.400
That require these people to handle yet you cannot move against them.

03:40.960 --> 03:45.520
Now the Chen and Xie families frequently intermarry if they unite.

03:45.600 --> 03:49.840
Will only become harder to deal with reform is necessary.

03:50.280 --> 03:53.480
But reform how should it be done?

04:13.760 --> 04:15.400
Treatise on Land.

04:23.800 --> 04:29.120
Sheng'er's political ideas are very good can indeed solve Xuan's current contradictions and problems.

04:29.560 --> 04:31.893
