04:32.640 --> 04:34.240
To successfully implement it.

04:35.320 --> 04:40.240
We need someone with a high enough position and who can put the state's interests first.

04:40.320 --> 04:41.720
And is absolutely trustworthy.

04:44.520 --> 04:47.680
Marquis of Yongning Xie Xuan.

